{
  "api": "8",
  "type": "anime",
  "name": "本地样例站",
  "version": "1.0",
  "baseURL": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/",
  "searchMode": "xpath",
  "chapterMode": "xpath",
  "searchURL": "http://127.0.0.1:8000/search?wd=@keyword",
  "searchList": "//div[@class='module-items']//div[@class='module-item']",
  "searchName": "//a[@class='module-item-title']/@title",
  "searchResult": "//a[@class='module-item-cover']/@href",
  "chapterRoads": "//div[@class='module-play-list']",
  "chapterResult": "//a/@href",
  "notes": "这是写给本地 fixture（http://127.0.0.1:8000/）的示例规则，不是真实站点。用途是离线跑通「搜索 → 详情 → 选集 → 嗅探 → 播放」全链路；规则页的「试跑」也可以拿它验证选择器是否被正确求值。请把 baseURL / searchURL 换成自己搭的假站点地址。"
}
